res: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: normal;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;font-weight: bolder;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.5px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></strong></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mvatddo3xb9" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">“大模型把猫和汽车分为一类，不是弱智。”</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在 AI 可解释性领域，有一个十年的经典案例，是</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;InceptionV1 模型里编号 4e:55 的神经元</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">。这个神经元在看到“猫脸”和“汽车车头”时，都会被强烈激活。这意味着，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">整个神经网络的底层逻辑是不可解释的</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">于是整整十年，整个领域都沿着 “拆” 的思路往前走：既然网络是一团乱麻的黑盒，那就发明工具把它拆开。稀疏自编码器（SAE）分解、特征字典、特征解缠…… 都是先把纠缠的特征拆成一个个独立的、人类能懂的单元，再去理解。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">就在昨天，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">OpenAI早期机制可解释性研究的科学家，也是当年将该案例推向经典的《Zoom In》的共同作者，Nick Cammarata ，亲自推翻了自己当年所下的结论。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;9669b7d3-591f-49ae-b164-1992d9fd697f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1025,&quot;width&quot;:785,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1025,&quot;currWidth&quot;:785,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1025,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:785,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCW4GbebzTofuMZxpBX0cVqoUnSg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CW4GbebzTofuMZxpBX0cVqoUnSg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:694340,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b2599dde.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.305732484076433" data-type="png" data-w="785" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="785" data-height="1025" data-backw="546" data-backh="713" data-imgfileid="100263585" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b2599dde.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">“这个神经元根本不认识猫，也不认识车。它检测的是V 字几何形状，不管是狐狸的尖脸、喷射的火焰，都会激活它的正极；而它的负极，是圆形的东西。”</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">他直言，这个误判的根源，或许是当年的观测工具太低级。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">2023 年他在 OpenAI 做第一个大规模自动化神经元解释项目，用现有工具只能解释大约 2% 的神经元。结果三年后，当他带着更先进的算法和 Agent 团队重新研究，发现情况完全不同。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在他们测试的现代视觉模型中，最后一层99%～100%的神经元都能找到相当清晰的解释。就连当年以 “深层混乱” 著称的 InceptionV1 本身，用新工具重新观测，可解释率大幅提升。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">因此，Nick Cammarata 发表了一篇需要阅读 65 分钟的长文</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">《Neural Networks Are Already Clean》</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，并提出了一个惊人之论：</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">神经网络本身，远比我们想象的要 “干净”</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这里的 “干净”，不是指“一个神经元只干一件事”，而是说网络内部有着极其连贯、精妙、且完全可以被人类直接阅读的组织结构。它就像一个规整的地图，想看细节就 “双击放大”</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">对此，OpenAI 核心研究员 roon 直接转发并惊呼，这是</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">“科学史上的重要时刻”，“我们终于可以把 AI 对齐，变成一门‘常规科学’了”。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">毕竟，这篇文章一旦成立，等于把过去十年可解释性研究的核心焦虑推翻了。AI 圈过去几年，花大力气搞的稀疏自编码器（SAE）分解、特征字典、特征解缠，可能都走错了路。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">或许，可解释性领域也可以用“The Bitter Lesson”来解决，即简单即高效。</span></strong></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvate6hv5uf"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b25d005b.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b25d005b.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">01</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">十年共识的诞生与反转</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为什么人们会认为“AI 的大脑”是一团乱麻呢？这一切要从 2014 年的 InceptionV1 视觉模型说起。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">作为可解释性研究早期的 “模型生物”，研究者发现，模型的表层神经元还算清晰，但越往深层走，越像一团乱麻。当时人们估计，最后一层能被人类看懂的神经元，学界认为只有区区 5%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">其中最出名的，是 4e:55 的神经元，它让两个八竿子打不着的东西共用一个神经元，怎么看都违背“一个神经元对应一个概念”的朴素预期。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为了解释这种现象，学术界提出了一个核心理论</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">“叠加假说”（Superposition）。他们认为，当神经元数量不够用时，AI 就会偷偷切换学习策略，把互不相关的概念“折叠”进同一个神经元里。因为它们很少同时激活，所以不会互相干扰。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">2020 年，Cammarata 与 Chris Olah 在里程碑级论文《Zoom In》中又给出了更具象的证据：网络竟然把汽车的特征信号藏进了一组“狗神经元”中，这更加实锤了叠加现象。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">既然神经网络是缠结的，那就必须发明工具把它强行“拆开”。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">一直以来，Anthropic 和 OpenAI 等顶尖实验室，都把稀疏自编码器（SAE）作为主流方案，其思路是训练一个辅助模型，把原本硬塞在神经元里的多个特征强行拽出来，重新分类，贴上人类可读的标签。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但 Nick Cammarata</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">发现，每次观测工具的升级，看似混乱的神经元就会自动变得清晰一些。他忍不住怀疑，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">或许问题根本不在神经网络，而在我们观察网络的工具上。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">从 2009 年特征可视化技术刚诞生时，合成的迷幻图案，到引入变换鲁棒性后，较为清晰的神经元可视化图像，再到如今 Nick Cammarata</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;团队通过微调参数，引导算法沿着“真实图像的激活路径”去观测，发现现代架构（如 ConvNeXt）最后一层 99% 以上的神经元变得清晰可读。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5206c540-83dd-405b-891e-4df4e90a2a9c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:596,&quot;width&quot;:1064,&quot;currHeight&quot;:596,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1064,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:596,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1064,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQVdeb5wzwobv1OxN0jocd2YpnGc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QVdeb5wzwobv1OxN0jocd2YpnGc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1050068,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b2636e62.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5601503759398496" data-type="png" data-w="1064" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1064" data-height="596" data-backw="546" data-backh="306" data-imgfileid="100263588" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b2636e62.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">原来这十年，大家一直在和工具误差较劲。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvatesm4453"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b26693f7.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b26693f7.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">02</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">两个经典案例的 “翻案”</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">工具升级之后，可解释性领域的两个 “多义性” 经典案例，双双迎来反转。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">整个反转的核心逻辑，是</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">用动态的机制与合理的几何特征，推翻了过去静态的、字面化的名词分类法。</span></strong></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvatf9l5ynu"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mqggjy08r8x" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="font-family:等线"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-pm-slice="1 1 [&quot;heading&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;h3&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:3}]"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">▎</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">案例一：“猫与汽车神经元” 案例</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">过去的特征可视化，本质是用梯度下降算法合成一张最能激活神经元的图。但算法为了追求最高激活值会“抄近路”，产生</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">“奖励作弊”（reward hacking）</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">问题。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">由于 ImageNet 训练集中猫狗类图片数量极多、特征极强，算法合成出的最强激活图像里，会混入猫的胡须、狗的皮毛这类语义残渣。研究者顺着这些附带特征解读，自然会误以为这是个 “动物神经元”。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为此，Nick Cammarata</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">团队用了两套更严谨的方法重新观测。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第一，激活路径引导：精细化微调正则化参数，强制约束算法必须沿着真实图像的天然激活路径去合成特征，从而剥离掉算法自身产生的干扰噪音。&nbsp;</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">第二，正负两极交叉验证法：不只研究 “什么能最强激活神经元”（正极），同时研究 “什么能最强抑制神经元”（负极），通过两端共同锚定神经元的真实功能。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">结果发现，神经网络原来是按照几何去分类的。在“猫车神经元” 案例里，它检测的是 V 字几何形状。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">任何 V 形轮廓都会触发它的正极，比如狐狸的尖脸、喷射的火焰、汽车的尖头、消防船喷出的 V 形水柱。反过来，所有圆形轮廓会触发它的负极，比如圆脸、圆球、圆形的车轮。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;9fe737da-ca3e-496e-ac74-c8c6a04f271d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:848,&quot;width&quot;:1051,&quot;currHeight&quot;:848,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1051,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:848,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1051,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIKgNbnKC4oZPUHx80QlcHOXVnPe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;IKgNbnKC4oZPUHx80QlcHOXVnPe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:672421,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b26bae2f.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.8068506184586108" data-type="png" data-w="1051" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1051" data-height="848" data-backw="546" data-backh="441" data-imgfileid="100263586" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b26bae2f.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvatffycgxg"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mqggjy08r8x" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="font-family:等线"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-pm-slice="1 1 [&quot;heading&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;h3&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:3}]"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">▎</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">案例二：“汽车与狗神经元” 案例</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">而另一组“汽车与狗”的案例也是同样的道理。InceptionV1 训练数据里狗的图片远多于汽车，狗相关神经元也更密集，优化过程掉进 “狗的图像盆地” 就爬不出来，最后合成的 “最强激活图” 全是狗。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6070e1bf-bee0-435f-9373-8b0d2b663f19&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:630,&quot;width&quot;:1230,&quot;currHeight&quot;:630,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1230,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:630,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1230,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FT1Fpbbhmcord3CxD1tKczbmdnUh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;T1Fpbbhmcord3CxD1tKczbmdnUh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:956861,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b2721f4e.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5121951219512195" data-type="png" data-w="1230" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1230" data-height="630" data-backw="546" data-backh="280" data-imgfileid="100263587" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b2721f4e.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为了查明真相，Nick Cammarata</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">团队这次引入了自动化 Agent 工具，对这组电路做了一场动态的梯度追踪和消融（控制变量剪线）实验。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">结合泛化轴线解离方法拆解后，他们发现，原来这组神经元根本不是 “狗神经元”，而是检测“物体是否正脸直接面对镜头、且两侧对称”的神经元。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">汽车的特征信号在这里被打上 “正面朝前” 的标签后，会继续向下游更深的层流动，并最终分流进真正的 “汽车分类电路” 和 “狗分类电路”。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;48f4e7c4-3b69-4e06-96b6-af3c53c13dc4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:306,&quot;width&quot;:799,&quot;currHeight&quot;:306,&quot;currWidth&quot;:799,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:306,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:799,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FENLHbvkjDoG28PxBS8QcEaxGnqb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ENLHbvkjDoG28PxBS8QcEaxGnqb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:32811,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b27417c6.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3829787234042553" data-type="png" data-w="799" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="799" data-height="306" data-backw="546" data-backh="209" data-imgfileid="100263584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b27417c6.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">之前多义性误读的根源其实在于数据集偏差。本质上，特征天然就会沿着信号进行连续的泛化与分流。</span></strong></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvatfpx12321"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b27780a2.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b27780a2.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">03</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">神经元的真相是递归泛化？</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">既然神经网络不是胡乱叠加，那“多义性”现象是怎么来的？</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Nick Cammarata 给出了一个新的解释：</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">递归泛化。</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">他认为，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">神经元像树枝一样生长。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">一个神经元最初或许只识别油菜花。沿着 “黄色” 这条特征轴，它慢慢拓展到识别所有黄色物体；沿着 “圆形外形” 这条轴，又延伸到各类球状物体；再顺着 “花田里的生物” 这个关联路径，进一步覆盖花田里的狗，最后延伸到绿色的西兰花。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">如果人类只看到这个神经元同时响应油菜花和西兰花，很容易误以为模型逻辑混乱。但只要追溯它生长的完整路径就会发现：每一次分叉、每一次特征延伸，都具备连贯的逻辑。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;84f33967-45ed-4536-a424-6c334f28b977&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:964,&quot;width&quot;:1244,&quot;currHeight&quot;:964,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1244,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:964,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1244,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FBDfXb1aBIogvUCxsQEIcTZuMnmd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;BDfXb1aBIogvUCxsQEIcTZuMnmd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:578225,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b27b8bd4.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.77491961414791" data-type="png" data-w="1244" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1244" data-height="964" data-backw="546" data-backh="423" data-imgfileid="100263592" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b27b8bd4.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在语言模型里，递归泛化现象更夸张。 比如，原本只检测 “iy” 发音的神经元，训练中先延伸到了识别 “diy” 这个词，到最后，连完全不含 “iy” 音的短语 “Do it yourself” 都能激活它。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;636493e6-5fd8-4e7c-a2ed-01c2cfb0917a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:386,&quot;width&quot;:911,&quot;currHeight&quot;:386,&quot;currWidth&quot;:911,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:386,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:911,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGIgrbQTsgoXGbhxdNOccusJBnog%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GIgrbQTsgoXGbhxdNOccusJBnog&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:42651,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b27dcaad.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.42371020856201974" data-type="png" data-w="911" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="911" data-height="386" data-backw="546" data-backh="231" data-imgfileid="100263589" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b27dcaad.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">所谓人类看不懂的逻辑，实际是神经网络在用它高维的逻辑，进行着语义延伸。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这时候，传统学派一定会反驳：如果神经元真的不够用了，神经网络难道不会切换到叠加模式吗？</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">为此，Nick Cammarata 设计了一个极限压力实验。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">他盯上了 InceptionV1 的 3b 层。这一层没有残差流，信号无法绕路传播。Nick Cammarata 将该层原本用于检测曲线的 480 个神经元，直接压缩至 10 个，相当于 48 倍压缩，然后从零重新训练。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;dc6d697f-06e1-4823-97c6-5915b400fccf&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:626,&quot;width&quot;:1324,&quot;currHeight&quot;:626,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1324,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:626,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1324,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FOPCMbvt65oeJ1txknDvcBVaLnWb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;OPCMbvt65oeJ1txknDvcBVaLnWb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:945750,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b283dce9.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.472809667673716" data-type="png" data-w="1324" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1324" data-height="626" data-backw="546" data-backh="258" data-imgfileid="100263593" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b283dce9.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">按叠加假说，空间严重不足时，神经网络肯定会把各种无关特征乱塞进这 10 个神经元。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">结果完全相反。这 10 个神经元个个清晰可解释，它们只是每个管得更宽了：一个“曲线与环”神经元，主动合并了原来 10 个不同角度的细分曲线检测器；两个“圆形”神经元，包揽了原本复杂的多种圆形分类。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">他还得到了一个颠覆性的发现，经过 SAE “解缠”拆出来的特征，不仅没有变干净，其响应宽度反而比原始神经元粗了好几倍。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这意味着那些过去几年让无数科学家欢呼、声称“从网络黑盒里解缠出来的叠加特征”……很可能，根本就是 SAE 这个工具自己制造出来的数学假象。</span></strong></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvatgkugh7s"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b28711c9.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b28711c9.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">04</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">网友质疑没有新花样</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">长文发布后，Nick Cammarata 的推特变成了网友们的大型提问区。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">有人提问，当未来出现非 Transformer 架构时，这套方法还适用吗？</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Nick Cammarata不仅给出肯定的回答，还表示</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">性能越好的模型，内部其实越容易被解释。</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">旧式卷积神经网络、新式卷积神经网络、现代 Transformer 模型这三种截然不同的底层架构，已经证明了这套理论的通用性。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;7cecab24-c9be-49e3-9b92-f7860021786d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:304,&quot;width&quot;:782,&quot;currHeight&quot;:304,&quot;currWidth&quot;:782,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:304,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:782,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FScBobT4oBojiVbx0rs6cYXLyn4g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ScBobT4oBojiVbx0rs6cYXLyn4g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:89975,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b2898da5.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3887468030690537" data-type="png" data-w="782" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="782" data-height="304" data-backw="546" data-backh="212" data-imgfileid="100263590" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b2898da5.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Zapier 联合创始人 Mike Knoop 在线追问，能不能直接把神经网络的“干净度”做成一个正式的行业评估指标？</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Nick Cammarata 表示这并不难。人类过去太低估原生电路的可研究性了，其实控制激活、消融剪线、盲区探测等方法，都可以直接给神经网络的底层秩序“打分”。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6fca0a08-8cd2-4b47-875c-0eb9578a2e56&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:453,&quot;width&quot;:782,&quot;currHeight&quot;:453,&quot;currWidth&quot;:782,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:453,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:782,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVf76bUMQfoqvhZx9VMncudRtnyd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Vf76bUMQfoqvhZx9VMncudRtnyd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:127545,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b28c439d.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5792838874680307" data-type="png" data-w="782" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="782" data-height="453" data-backw="546" data-backh="316" data-imgfileid="100263591" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b28c439d.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">而叠加理论的核心奠基人之一， Google DeepMind 机制可解释性团队负责人 Neel Nanda，却直接泼了一盆冷水。他直言：“这篇文章虽然有趣，但对于可解释性而言，并没有带来什么实质性的突破”。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;84b81650-8c2c-47ef-b2a6-1320f0d327b8&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:178,&quot;width&quot;:778,&quot;currHeight&quot;:178,&quot;currWidth&quot;:778,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:178,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:778,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJ9ypb9PJxooWtQxEmMccUd2Sn6S%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;J9ypb9PJxooWtQxEmMccUd2Sn6S&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:37929,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b28e4518.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.22879177377892032" data-type="png" data-w="778" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="778" data-height="178" data-backw="546" data-backh="125" data-imgfileid="100263594" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b28e4518.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Neel 一针见血地指出，双方争论的根本不是同一个 “叠加”。&nbsp;</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">“叠加” 这个词在领域里至少有五六种定义，最核心的是两种，一种是</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">“任意叠加”</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，即网络会把毫无关系的特征塞在一个神经元里，这是 Cammarata 推翻的版本。 另一种是他所捍卫的&nbsp;</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">“表征叠加”</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，大语言模型能记住远超神经元数量的知识，靠的是用极少数的神经元通过线性组合去表达海量的概念。二者的靶子本就不在一处。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在此基础上，Neel 从三个维度提出了具体的技术质疑。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">首先是“弱激活”的定位问题。</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Nick 认为弱激活大多是语义延伸的次级树枝，砍掉也无伤大雅。但 Neel 指出，弱神经元激活里存储了海量的事实和记忆组合，正是叠加的核心载体。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Neel 同时强调，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">论文最扎实的证据全部来自视觉模型，但视觉和语言本质上不同。</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">语言模型是海量事实、记忆、知识的载体，信息密度高几个量级。小图像模型本身记忆能力就差，不能证明大语言模型里也没有叠加。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">最后是为SAE（稀疏自编码器）正名。</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Neel 澄清，SAE 在残差流上依然是不可替代的工具，它能敏锐地反映模型每一层的信息瓶颈。这不是谁取代谁的问题，两者各有适用场景。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">针对这些质疑，Cammarata 也认同。他承认自己的文章只是一个“工作假设”，还有几个关键问题他没解决：</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">可解释性并没有因为模型变大而“饱和”，巨型模型的内部依然很干净。这种超级规模本身带来的其他工程挑战，目前还远远没有被彻底解决。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">覆盖范围上，研究只涉及视觉和语言单模态模型，视觉 - 语言融合的多模态模型，尤其是融合层的电路组织形式，完全没有覆盖，很可能和单模态的规律完全不同。&nbsp;</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">核心机制上，递归泛化只在图像模型里完整追踪了训练全过程；语言模型缺少训练过程的检查点数据，没法直接观测神经元一步步泛化的过程，只能从最终形态反推规律。&nbsp;</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">工具定位上，他从未全盘否定 SAE：实验只证明在极度压缩的层上，SAE 拆不出干净的原生特征；但在正常未压缩的原始层，SAE 和原生神经元的形状匹配度高达 0.96-1.00，依然是高效工具。&nbsp;</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">方法局限上，目前的结论高度依赖转向导向实验和归因图，本质都是 “扰动看效果” 的思路；不主动扰动系统、纯自然状态下的严格因果验证，目前仍是开放问题。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">即便这只是一份工作假设，它也正在迫使四个方向的从业者重新校准自己的技术方向：</span></section><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">做可解释性的团队</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">：别再执着于用 SAE 去给网络做解缠手术了。直接抬头看原生神经元和电路，开展快速的常规观测。</span></section></li><li><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">做安全对齐的团队</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">：这绝对是个好消息。如果原生网络天然可读，意味着对齐超级智能的门槛比想象中要低——虽然对齐依然困难，但至少“理解 AI 的门槛”暴跌了。</span></section></li><li><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">做架构设计的团队</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">：残差流和 LayerNorm 这些为了让模型“学得更好”的改进，竟然意外地让网络变得更易读。未来的架构搜索完全可以把“可解释性”光明正大地加进指标里，因为它和性能完全兼容！</span></section></li><li><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">做应用层的工程团队</span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">：未来调控 AI 行为不需要再重新微调了。通过行为干预工程，“调节一个神经元，就直接改变模型在特定法律/医疗场景下的行为”，将从论文概念直接变成生产线上的产品功能！</span></section></li></ul><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">十年前，我们看着模糊的神经元图像，得出了 “神经网络不可解释” 的结论。 十年后才发现，混乱的从来不是网络，是我们先入为主的偏见。Rich Sutton 的 “The Bitter Lesson” 再次回响：</span><strong><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在理解 AI 的道路上，大道，终究至简。</span></strong></section><section style="text-align: left;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 14px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvatddnmstu"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;font-style: italic;">参考链接：https://already-clean.goodfire.com/</span></span></section><section style="text-align: left;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 14px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvatddnnlth"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;font-style: italic;">https://x.com/NeelNanda5/status/2110875974296654062</span></span></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b290e546.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafPCDnED8CYSJMDegJx4AnNhF6ib4kgfdPZiat6u9QRrsAY4leazGbmme1ibc9CTIcISGKWMMkWhicCjUkuIYzpMYA2tmtjOdr9fL74/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="223" data-imgfileid="100253417" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b290e546.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mpzpilb31bbr"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;" data-mpa-action-id="mp0lz1ofco1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;width: 677px;transform: rotate(0deg);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;width: 50px;height: 4px;background-color: rgb(68, 153, 231);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><svg viewbox="0 0 1 1" style="float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;" mpa-from-tpl="t"></svg></section></section><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: -4px;padding: 10px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">上车，雷峰网带你看遍全球 AI 顶会精华</span></span></strong></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg2nab13jb"></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 16px 8px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">可独家畅览：</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">专家演讲PPT</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">大会报告全文</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">热门论文解读</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">学术新星访谈</span></span></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg35eosx9"></span><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b29442ab.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafMqpEPibJ4AOibc6RBL778iaiciaVgquCMrS14ia0XmXfw3YAU5iaSJzBYQOBMNGlM0ic387w7rB6QnU0PO9KPyGqXc8vu6ib2OlB3QIIIQ/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="546" data-imgfileid="100262550" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad20b29442ab.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">扫描上方二维码</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">或点击</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">「</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">阅读原文</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">」</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">关注专区。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><span data-lark-record-format="docx/record"></span></section><section><span data-mpa-action-id="mipr37w01zjd"></span></section>]]></description>
