<item>
<title>长鑫科技市值两月内跌去1万亿；阿里加码AI硬件品牌，天猫、速卖通联动；国行版苹果AI有望12月上线，百度、阿里参与合作丨雷峰早报</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/zaobao/EReMkZNn9w5H85Tf.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" nodeleaf=""></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">要闻提示</span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section data-mpa-action-id="mv9t3pblgoq" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;">1.长鑫科技市值两月内跌去1万亿</section><section style="text-align: justify;">2.年内已至少18次故障！DeepSeek发放宕机补偿，有人拿到3000元</section><section style="text-align: justify;">3.阿里加码AI硬件品牌，天猫、速卖通联动</section><section style="text-align: justify;">4.国行版苹果AI有望12月上线，百度、阿里参与合作</section><section style="text-align: justify;">5.可灵AI新一代模型Kling 4.0正式上线，专业影像模型“卷”出新高度</section><section style="text-align: justify;">6.华为黄宇：韬定律最大挑战在于 EDA 工具</section><section style="text-align: justify;">7.内饰一模一样！海外博主称中国车企已进入互相抄袭阶段：理想高管回应</section><p style="text-align: justify;">8.OpenAI基础设施负责人将离职</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>今日头条</strong></span></p></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mmxst4fs1xis" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam1od114ht" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mv9t4v661yb" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9t51a6x6a" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>长鑫科技市值两月内跌去1万亿</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日，长鑫科技股价走低，截至收盘，股价43.59元/股，总市值跌破3万亿元。A股“总市值一哥”的位置随之易主，工商银行重回A股总市值第一。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">长鑫科技7月27日上市首日，盘中市值超过工商银行，登顶A股市值首位。8月17日，长鑫科技收61.8元/股，市值达到4.2万亿元。在随后约两个月时间里，长鑫科技市值先是跌破4万亿元，又跌破3万亿元。8月17日收盘至10月14日，长鑫科技股价跌去25.57%，市值跌去1.07万亿元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">长鑫科技在近两个月时间里多次更新了技术及产品研发进展。此前报道，10月10日，长鑫存储总裁曹堪宇称，长鑫存储预计年底推出采用4F² DRAM（动态随机存取存储器）架构的新一代DDR5 RDIMM产品。（第一财经）</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国内资讯</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9svywoj9j" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>年内已至少18次故障！DeepSeek发放宕机补偿，有人拿到3000元</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 15 日消息，DeepSeek发布通知，针对15日早间出现的API服务故障道歉，并给API用户发放补偿。作为补偿，DeepSeek将按用户账号7日内（10.8-10.14）的消耗金额以赠金形式全额返还，赠金自动到账，API计费扣款先从赠金账户扣除。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">通知发布后，不少网友开始晒已经到账的补偿金，有的过去一周只用了少量API，因此补偿金只有几毛、几元，但有些用户过去一周需求较多、使用量大，补偿金则有几百甚至超过三千元。有用户表示DeepSeek “补偿挺有诚意”；还有用户将这一操作调侃为“梁式重置额度”。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">针对此次服务故障，DeepSeek并未解释说明原因。据悉，此次宕机期间，有网友建议DeepSeek换一批算力硬件，还有网友声称“传说是算力调走去憋个大的”。值得注意的是，2026年以来该平台至少出现18次大面积服务异常，平均每月一到两次，其中9月份最少出现7次服务波动。（第一财经、快科技）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;62fce969-cd13-49c7-ac8a-f86966037a8b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:239.358605664488,&quot;width&quot;:494,&quot;currHeight&quot;:239.358605664488,&quot;currWidth&quot;:494,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:2224,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:4590,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.10762527233115468,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FH49lbXbNJo6pEfxhA3WcaoCsnsc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;H49lbXbNJo6pEfxhA3WcaoCsnsc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:747553,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd86efe72.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4842592592592593" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="4590" data-height="2224" data-backw="578" data-backh="280" data-imgfileid="504274509" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd86efe72.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9t7zcc1xbg" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>父承子业？影视飓风回应Tim父亲出任公司董事长</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，公开信息显示，近日，影视飓风关联公司杭州星奥传媒有限公司发生工商变更，圆通速递董事兼总裁潘水苗出任该企业董事长一职。同时，企业经营范围新增预包装食品销售、电影制片、互联网信息内容多渠道分发服务。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">本次变更后，创始人潘天鸿（Tim）仍担任公司法定代表人、经理及董事，且为最大股东，持股比例51.77%；潘水苗持股25.65%，为第二大股东。据公开报道，潘水苗是潘天鸿父亲。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">针对此事，“影视飓风”创始人潘天鸿（Tim）最新进行了回应：从公司创立之初潘水苗就是执行董事，不参与经营，只是现在为了公司发展需要，设立了董事会。本次经营变更主要是增加了一些经营类目，接下来会有一些有趣的产品推出。（新浪科技、快科技）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;468bd367-0fdf-41e6-a2db-4d743a1783a2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:293.6166666666667,&quot;width&quot;:446,&quot;currHeight&quot;:293.6166666666667,&quot;currWidth&quot;:446,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:395,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.7433333333333333,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVX6Tbr9YFoktj2xnAUScZkPwnjg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VX6Tbr9YFoktj2xnAUScZkPwnjg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:601101,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd873b919.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6583333333333333" data-type="png" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="395" data-backw="578" data-backh="381" data-imgfileid="504274505" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd873b919.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9t8cgpksz"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>阿里加码AI硬件品牌，天猫、速卖通联动</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，近日有报道称，阿里正在接触一批AI硬件品牌，除提供天使轮投资外，还可能联动国内外电商业务，为品牌提供天使轮投资和全球市场拓展支持。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>值得注意的是，速卖通将于10月19日召开年度暨双11商家大会，公开议程中罕见出现了天猫。多方信息指向，阿里可能在会上公布一项面向AI硬件品牌的海内外联动计划。</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>国行版苹果AI有望12月上线，百度、阿里参与合作</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，据外媒报道，苹果计划于今年 12 月通过 iOS 27.3 系统更新正式推出苹果智能，首批上线的是两年前已在美国发布的 AI 功能。另据报道，苹果执行董事长库克最新透露，苹果智能在中国已经获得批准。10月晚些时候有个测试版本，首批功能有实时翻译、写作工具、图像消除，Siri AI不包括在里面。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">苹果AI在国内采用双合作伙伴的模式。据外媒报道，苹果将在 Siri 语音助手及视觉智能（Visual Intelligence）功能中嵌入百度的软件服务。第三方开发者对iOS 27 Beta 2固件的拆解验证了这一信息。拆解显示，系统内新增了名为“Baidu Visual Search”的模块，指向视觉搜索能力的接入。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>此前据国内媒体报道，阿里将作为 AI 能力集成至 Apple 智能，为 iOS、iPadOS、macOS 和 visionOS 的中国用户提供文本与图像理解、内容生成等智能体验。9 月 29 日取得的许可范围，同时覆盖 Apple Intelligence 与阿里 AI 模型，包括通义万相和 Qwen。</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>可灵AI新一代模型Kling 4.0正式上线，专业影像模型“卷”出新高度</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日，可灵AI新一代视频生成模型 Kling 4.0 正式上线。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">Kling 4.0 聚焦高动态、强运镜的视频创作场景，在三个方向实现集中突破：大幅度动态表现更稳定，提升高速运动与复杂运镜的连贯性；单次原生生成最长可达30秒，支持长镜头与连续叙事，导演思维全程在线；全能参考支持最多15项参考素材组合，同时支持最多10张关键帧输入，帮助创作者将一个构思转化为完整作品。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>核心镜头的高质量交付，是可灵模型持续迭代的重要方向。专业创作者需要的不只是偶然生成惊艳画面，更要稳定完成决定作品品质的关键镜头，并让生成素材进入完整制作流程。</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>华为黄宇：韬定律最大挑战在于 EDA 工具</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 15 日消息，据媒体报道，华为半导体 EDA 首席科学家黄宇在 2026 湾芯展上表示，韬定律最大挑战在于 EDA 工具。同时工艺挑战、工程挑战和系统设计挑战也都存在。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">黄宇透露，华为的韬（τ）定律主要分四层：最基础的器件层，优化晶体管结构和互联方式，从源头压缩器件时间常数；第二层是链路层，这是他们最大的创新点；第三层是芯片层，软硬件协同设计，形成新架构；第四层是系统层，即大家熟知的超级节点、机柜互联，需要更好的通讯协议和更快的速度。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>据了解，EDA 全称电子设计自动化。它是指利用计算机辅助设计（CAD）软件来完成超大规模集成电路（VLSI）芯片及电子系统的功能设计、综合、验证、布局和布线等全流程的软件工具链。在半导体与微电子领域，EDA 被称为“芯片之母”。芯片设计师设计成百上亿个晶体管组成的芯片时，必须依赖 EDA 软件。（IT之家）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>字节跳动洽谈采购联发科AI芯片，用于数据中心算力搭建</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，据悉，字节跳动正与联发科就采购数据中心定制芯片进行深入谈判，相关芯片将用于字节跳动的数据中心。知情人士透露，联发科预计将向字节跳动供应一定数量的专用集成电路（ASIC），但具体规模尚未披露，双方尚未正式宣布达成协议。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">对联发科而言，如果交易达成，字节跳动有望成为其继谷歌之后第二家大型ASIC客户。这也将推动联发科进一步拓展数据中心业务，与高通、博通等厂商竞争，降低对智能手机芯片业务的依赖。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>字节跳动正加大AI基础设施投入，将人工智能视为下一阶段的重要增长引擎。由于无法获得英伟达等厂商最先进的AI芯片，且华为等本土供应商尚无法满足全部需求，字节跳动正探索与芯片设计厂商合作等替代方案。今年早些时候，字节跳动已与高通达成类似采购安排，计划采购数百万颗AI芯片。（快科技）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>内饰一模一样！海外博主称中国车企已进入互相抄袭阶段：理想高管回应</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，近日，一海外博主在社交平台发文，针对巴黎车展多款中国高端SUV提出了自己的看法。而相关内容被国内博主转发至微博后，理想汽车“硬哥”又转发这条内容并评论：“也不是互相抄袭吧，只抄袭了一家”。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">该海外博主表示，中国汽车制造商进入了一个奇特的阶段，车企不再抄袭西方产品，转而开始互相抄袭，这一现象在高端SUV车型上尤为突出，巴黎车展上大约有七款这类车型。他提到，这些车型外观尚可区分，但内饰相似度极高。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">博主称，多款车型搭载基于安卓开发、界面布局与功能几乎一致的车机软件，仪表盘、中控台设计、硬件配置高度雷同。博主还提到，他试驾过其中多款车型，车辆动力系统与驾驶特性差异很小。同时他认为，不止高端SUV，不少无关联中国车企的产品都存在该问题，车辆硬件技术亮眼，但缺少原创性，不过依靠标准化的配置采购，足以支撑产品取得市场成功。（快科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;16acae9a-19a2-4fdd-aaf6-d2fa225503b6&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:447,&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;currHeight&quot;:447,&quot;currWidth&quot;:600,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:447,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FOCDCbxyhIoJ8AtxtnMZcH6bIn8y%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;OCDCbxyhIoJ8AtxtnMZcH6bIn8y&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:73726,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd87682f8.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.745" data-type="png" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="447" data-backw="578" data-backh="431" data-imgfileid="504274507" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd87682f8.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9t9kb2gim" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Kimi 17岁天才少年陈广宇宣布离职！论文曾获马斯克点赞</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，月之暗面17岁天才少年陈广宇在社交平台发布动态，宣布离开Kimi。他回顾了过去在Kimi工作的经历，直言：“过去在Kimi的这一年，是我迄今为止人生中最美好的一年。”</p><p style="text-align: justify;">今年3月，Kimi团队发布了一篇名为《Attention Residuals》（注意力残差）的技术论文，尝试改进大模型沿用多年的残差连接机制，引发AI圈广泛讨论，还获得了马斯克的点赞。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">这篇论文的三位同等贡献共同第一作者中，就有年仅17岁、还在读高三的陈广宇。而Attention Residuals后来也成为月之暗面新一代大模型Kimi K3的关键技术之一。（智猩猩AI）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;eecd9460-8f0e-4f65-8b53-fe6509554723&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:319.9425925925926,&quot;width&quot;:394,&quot;currHeight&quot;:319.9425925925926,&quot;currWidth&quot;:394,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:877,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.3648148148148148,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FXrYCbyEzhoLVbjxuLm6c0i4gnYb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;XrYCbyEzhoLVbjxuLm6c0i4gnYb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:401863,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd87ab3f6.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.812037037037037" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="877" data-backw="578" data-backh="469" data-imgfileid="504274508" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd87ab3f6.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9ta1l8247s" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>全球顶尖白帽、知名安全研究员古河，入职智谱</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，全球顶尖白帽、知名安全研究员古河（Yuki Chen）近日已正式加入智谱，进入GLM基础模型组工作，核心任务为提升大模型的网络安全（cyber）能力。古河此前连续多年位列微软 MSRC“最具价值安全研究者”年度榜单榜首，曾任360漏洞研究院院长。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>智谱海外官方账号Z.ai已同步确认其加盟消息，并对外披露，古河及其团队利用GLM模型挖掘得到的23个Windows漏洞，已经全部得到微软安全响应中心MSRC的确认与致谢。（科创板日报）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>百度推出短剧产品“文剧汇”，与腾讯字节同台竞技</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 15 日消息，百度在微信端已上线短剧漫剧产品“文剧汇”，产品以小程序形态落地，剧场板块区分短剧与漫剧内容。但相比红果成熟的推荐算法，文剧汇目前内容库体量偏小，内容更新节奏还未拉满，更像是百度在短剧赛道放出的试水产品。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>上手体验来看，文剧汇界面布局贴近字节红果、腾讯绿泡泡这类成熟产品，点开剧集就能直接播放，整体走广告免费观看路线。百度入局，也让免费短剧、漫剧赛道的大厂对垒格局再添一员。（读佳）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>阿里达摩院荣钰创业，成立「格致涌现」进军科学智能赛道</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">雷峰网鲸犀频道独家获悉，阿里达摩院科学智能（AI for Science）负责人荣钰离职创业成立新公司「格致涌现」，业务方向锁定科学智能。消息称，新公司已获得头部投资机构的投资。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">公开资料显示，荣钰为阿里巴巴达摩院资深技术专家，于 2016 年在香港中文大学取得系统工程与工程管理博士学位并从事博士后研究。2017 年 6 月，荣钰加入腾讯 AI Lab 担任专家研究员，2024 年 6 月加入阿里巴巴达摩院，负责 AI for Science 方向的研究。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>荣钰此次以创业形式将这一技术方向独立商业化，被视为科学智能从实验室走向产业的关键信号。在科学智能相关的多个方向中，虚拟细胞是当下市场讨论的热点。（鲸犀）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>OpenCode 宣布 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 免费提供，但仅支持 200K 上下文</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 15 日消息，OpenCode 宣布，DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 现已免费提供，免费版实测支持 200K 上下文窗口，相比 1M 上下文版本有所降低。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">此次免费开放是在此前“Operation Cheepseek”计划基础上的进一步动作。今年 9 月，OpenCode 曾将 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 在 OpenCode Go 套餐中的使用额度从 15 美元临时提升至 60 美元，随后于 10 月 12 日将该额度调整为 80 美元。此次免费开放后，该模型在 OpenCode 平台内的调用不再计入额度消耗。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 于 2026 年 9 月 10 日正式发布，是一款原生多模态 MoE 模型，主干参数规模为 552B，另含 196B Engram 条件记忆参数。（IT之家）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>OPPO与Manus合作，Find X10系列将首发搭载</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，OPPO 与Manus 合作，由 Manus 提供能力支持的 AI Mind Pilot 功能，将在搭载 ColorOS 17 的 OPPO Find X10 系列手机上首发。媒体获悉，此次合作仅限于海外版本。（科创板日报）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;fbce66a4-0df4-4e33-8840-d3a4117a63c8&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:251.99999999999997,&quot;width&quot;:378,&quot;currHeight&quot;:251.99999999999997,&quot;currWidth&quot;:378,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:720,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.35,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIWbqbjaUooLV3MxerBdcdVr3nng%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;IWbqbjaUooLV3MxerBdcdVr3nng&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:53549,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd87d31ac.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6666666666666666" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="720" data-backw="578" data-backh="385" data-imgfileid="504274506" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd87d31ac.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9tb0zj1kxw" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>娃哈哈一分公司疑似出现“盗窃”，超60吨塑料“消失”</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日，有报道称，娃哈哈一分公司“白山宏胜饮料有限公司”近日被发现原料“盗窃”，超60吨塑料粒子被盗。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">有知情人士透露， 目前该案还在调查中，多位员工确认已经立案，“起因是内部员工举报被盗，公司内部审查账目对不上。还有员工反映，很多塑料粒子直接不入库就拉走了，具体（丢失）数量要以集团公司或公安稽查最终裁决为准。”对于上述情况，娃哈哈方面暂无回应。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据悉，塑料粒子是饮料厂用来生产PET瓶子的原材料。在工业包装领域，通常以每袋1吨或1.05吨的大工业吨包形态存放于仓库。公开信息显示，白山宏胜饮料有限公司原名“白山娃哈哈饮料有限公司”，于2025年12月正式更名为白山宏胜饮料有限公司。（新浪科技）</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国际资讯</strong></span></p></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam15q08cj"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>马斯克提前购置ASML EUV光刻机</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">马斯克的芯片项目Terafab正在快速建设，以准备早日开始芯片设计与制造。据知情人士透露，该项目可能在明年年中迎来其首台阿斯麦EUV光刻设备。此前，研究机构曾预测，Terafab研发工厂的主体结构要到2027年底才能完工，而设备要到当年晚些时候才会开始安装。因此这台传闻中的EUV光刻设备可能将闲置一段时间。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">马斯克曾经暗示，Terafab计划应用一种新的极紫外光生成方法，使用自由电子激光器（FEL）代替阿斯麦的激光等离子体光源。Terafab提前购置阿斯麦光刻机的消息也意味着，这个项目的第一代产品仍将依赖更为传统的设备。但这也不令人意外，因为Terafab计划采用英特尔的14A制造技术。英特尔的14A工艺不仅会使用现有的低数值孔径EUV扫描仪，还会使用下一代高数值孔径EUV设备。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>而使用非常规且未经充分测试光源的光刻系统，将需要对制造工艺进行重大修改、广泛的设备认证，并且可能需要对光掩模和光刻胶进行更改，这将使英特尔14A技术的转移变得复杂，并延迟Terafab的量产爬坡。（科创板日报）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>OpenAI基础设施负责人将离职</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，据外媒报道，OpenAI 的基础设施负责人 Sachin Katti 周三宣布，他将在人工智能公司工作大约一年后离职。Katti 在 LinkedIn 上发帖称，他“决定离开去开创新的事业”，并将于 11 月 15 日最后一天离职后继续以顾问身份为 OpenAI 提供支持。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">一位发言人表示，一直担任 OpenAI 计算首席技术官的 Uday Ruddarraju 将接替 Katti，领导公司的整体计算部门。领英资料显示，Uday Ruddarraju 于去年7月加入OpenAI。此前，他曾担任埃隆·马斯克旗下xAI的基础设施工程主管，该公司后被SpaceX收购。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>Katti的离职是OpenAI今年一系列高管离职事件中的最新一起。今年7月， OpenAI产品和业务负责人Fidji Simo表示，她将转任顾问，专注于从“慢性病严重恶化”中恢复。次月， OpenAI资深高管Brad Lightcap和营收负责人 &nbsp;Denise Dresser也离开了公司。（三言科技）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>中国大陆市场占23%！阿斯麦CFO：不同意对华禁售DUV，会倒逼中国自研光刻机加速</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，据外媒报道，ASML 首席财务官 Roger Dassen 在第三季度业绩公布后的记者电话会上表示，公司反对美国国会限制其向中国销售深紫外光刻设备的提案。他的定性很直接：这是一个糟糕的主意。理由是，如果 MATCH 法案在美国中期选举之后获得通过，会加速中国相关技术的研发。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">不过他同时也对外表态，自己乐观地认为，后续决策层面常识最终会占上风，这类不合理的提案大概率不会最终落地。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">根据ASML最新公开的三季度财报，今年三季度中国大陆市场占到阿斯麦总净销售额的比例恰好为23%。戴厚杰随后做出预测，2026年全年，中国大陆市场的整体业务占比会稳定维持在20%左右的区间。（快科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;cc679f53-82a6-4c55-baf2-3cac080d410c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:400,&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;currHeight&quot;:400,&quot;currWidth&quot;:600,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:400,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FTdGjbB3S4oB9y5xYWZWci4FNnml%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;TdGjbB3S4oB9y5xYWZWci4FNnml&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:203525,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-backh="385" data-backw="578" data-height="400" data-imgfileid="504274511" data-ratio="0.6666666666666666" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd882242f.jpg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="600" data-width="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd882242f.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9tdd741hd3" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>马斯克：星链不能用于进攻性作战，使用场景仅限防御和普通民用服务</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月15日消息，近日SpaceX首席执行官马斯克公开发声，明确对外表态称，公司运营的星链系统不会被用于实施进攻性作战任务，使用场景仅限防御用途以及普通民用服务范畴。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">马斯克在社交平台上详细厘清了两套相关系统的权责边界，专门面向军事定制开发的星盾系统所有权完全归美国政府所有，全程由美方直接管控。这套军事系统在使用优先级、运行范围上的所有限制规则，全部由美军确立，最高决策权限最终归属美国总统。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">他特意强调，普通面向公众商用的星链属于商业服务体系，所有权和日常运营权都掌握在SpaceX手中。星链的全部定位都仅限民用场景，或是在合规前提下服务于防御类军事任务，绝对不会接入任何进攻性军事行动的执行链路，因为这类高风险任务对于民营商业公司而言完全不合适。（快科技）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8a7e455a-a2ac-4595-852c-c5931b38b4d5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:271.32,&quot;width&quot;:408.00000000000006,&quot;currHeight&quot;:271.32,&quot;currWidth&quot;:408.00000000000006,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:399,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.68,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FP1kObh0ZfoUEzDxNVzUc94p4nxb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;P1kObh0ZfoUEzDxNVzUc94p4nxb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:99841,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd88441b8.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.665" data-type="jpeg" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="399" data-backw="578" data-backh="384" data-imgfileid="504274510" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261016/6ad1fd88441b8.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv9tds2p209g"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>黄仁勋：英伟达在 AI 安全领域必须与中国企业合作</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 15 日消息，黄仁勋接受外媒采访时表示，英伟达“绝对有必要”与中国 AI 企业合作，共同监测这项前沿技术带来的风险。英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋认为，AI 具有潜在危险性。他认为自己的公司绝对有必要与中国 AI 企业携手监测这些危险。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">黄仁勋对此解释称：“我们绝对应该相互合作，以安全的方式推动 AI 发展。”他认为，与中国人工智能企业的合作应通过“对话”实现，并透露自己一直在和中国的研究人员交流。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">AI 安全已成为中美两国讨论的重要议题，随着人工智能迅速发展，两国都在权衡如何应对风险。美国财政部长贝森特曾向中方提议，建立双边 AI 安全风险通报机制与沟通渠道，以应对 AI 智能体失控、网络安全及生物威胁等潜在危机。（IT之家）</p></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
